{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"efddbce929562204fc50c65beadd3a04bfdb026b831fe9078253f5bddaca16d0","ja":"エレナのお誘い","zh":"艾丽娜的邀请","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"196118f181a2edbac7bc5d389e04a35f464c30aeb0af130e51dcc48d83ff0082","ja":"今日のエレナと風花のお仕事は歌番組への出演。\n無事に終えて、楽屋に戻ってきて……","zh":"今天绘莲娜和风花的工作是出演音乐节目。\n顺利结束后，回到休息室……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ad44735e4159f7c9cd05defae1803699fc9f1a354ef79fde0ad7107b87cd24fa","ja":"フーカ、さっきはありがと～！\n教えてもらえなかったら、立ち位置間違えてたヨ～。","zh":"风花，刚才谢谢你啦～！\n要不是你提醒我，我站位都要站错了呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c46aa05f22c90c1fdaa91312df9f02ed24c721af89404a0f77ba53c9fa2c3f84","ja":"どういたしまして。こちらこそありがとう。\n言葉につまったとき、助けてもらえてほっとしたわ。","zh":"不客气。我才该谢谢你。\n在我不知道该说什么好的时候，多亏你帮忙解围，让我松了口气。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"388f75f19176a9b908935ef6e0e2a26cbeeb2493b730e2293a56616d82b24be9","ja":"エヘヘ、今日もワタシたち、息ぴったりだったネ！\n楽しかったナ～！","zh":"嘿嘿，今天我们也是配合默契呢！\n真开心呀～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b73786fa355b6acb8c5c4c8eb81137127456f2dd4f7df7cf8f595096999b1bb0","ja":"あ、そうだ。フーカはこの後、何か予定あるノ？\nなかったら、ここに行こうヨ！","zh":"啊，对了。风花等下有什么安排吗？\n要是没有的话，一起去这里吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6c77184aefa99c6b7bc34ae89f4b42e3cd45b209c0c399adad830db9517a02ab","ja":"シュラスコのお店？　美味しそうだね！\n今日はお仕事終わりだから、一緒に行きましょう♪","zh":"巴西烤肉店？听起来好好吃哦！\n今天工作已经结束了，一起去吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b3daaf9a3884869a9640bd0c42c0b572c2bdfc53ea0751a683440d29ea378134","ja":"やった～！　今日は、サンバのイベントがあるんだヨ～♪\nほら、チラシの裏を見てみて。","zh":"太棒啦～！今天有桑巴活动哦～♪\n看，快瞧瞧传单背面。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1c0f03f4a5de293d2394709654a066e6cd3e2c8b32ed1c233870a1260f54303e","ja":"へぇ～、お店にダンサーさんが来るんだ。\n面白そうだね♪","zh":"欸～，会有舞者来店里啊。\n感觉很有意思呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ffdcd851f7318305f11e1ca5836891f5fd0d2a5ab1786070ac9892bb996fbf58","ja":"（あれ？　『衣装貸出アリ！　お客さんの\n飛び入り参加も大歓迎！』って……ええ～っ！？）","zh":"（咦？　“可租借服装！　非常欢迎观众\n临时上台！”这是……诶诶～！？）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6ad91d697bbe7e24bc2faea465ff80f84cdd73bc02e795ab5dbe7b4ed2dad214","ja":"楽しみだナ～♪\nいっぱい食べて、いっぱいダンスしようネ！","zh":"好期待呀～♪\n大吃一顿，然后尽情跳舞吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"646f9fd90fcb50596352ed2998bedbe8414d90f663e376a3ec125bc98bb8d012","ja":"（わ、私もサンバの衣装を着て踊るの！？\nそんな……！）","zh":"（我、我也要穿上桑巴的服装跳舞吗！？\n怎么会……！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"d0edef81379ee94dbab2e7c620b0827a6b4e623385b77ecd5ab450e5b80d207a","ja":"あ、あのね、エレナちゃん……\n私、ダンスをするのはちょっと……。","zh":"那个、艾莲娜……\n跳舞对我来说有点……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"34c807f78b5574f5e8629a1752acb32e7069ce8db49330a54085f6542993f037","ja":"ワタシとフーカなら、サンバもきっと息ぴったりだヨ♪\nそれじゃあ、お店にレッツゴー！","zh":"我和风花的话，跳起桑巴也肯定默契十足哦♪\n那我们就出发去店里吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1705.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8f9b235b8dc1e77a4f60fb7db401c9973a9c186cdfac8dbf66ba9321b76338bb","ja":"（うう、こんなに嬉しそうな顔して……\n踊りたくないなんて言えない……）","zh":"（呜呜，露出这么开心的表情……\n根本说不出不想跳舞这种话啊……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
